"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "f3550506",
"en_raw": "There really is nobody here..."
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "c188f733",
"en_raw": "So the rumor is true after all"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "7f55fff6",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "d54cdb9c",
"en_raw": "What's wrong, Melos?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "79187f15",
"en_raw": "Melos...?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "a0b89ed8",
"en_raw": "There's nothing scary at all..."
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "3169e978",
"en_raw": "Look around / Run away  Is something there...?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "cb21c512",
"en_raw": "There must be something..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "5d27b0b4",
"en_raw": "Maybe we should get away from here"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "23baf571",
"en_raw": "Around here"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "e2e0e2e2",
"en_raw": "have you seen a big dog?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "722f7884",
"en_raw": "Oh, it's you kids"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "381c8f88",
"en_raw": "Haven't you met the dog today either?"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "6b40212d",
"en_raw": "No, I haven't..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "72b4f2a6",
"en_raw": "But is that the one from the rumor?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "a53b60e4",
"en_raw": "It's become a rumor?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "a035d5d7",
"en_raw": "...What a pain"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "db3e23c6",
"en_raw": "Um, is it really out there?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "508be5a1",
"en_raw": "About the rumored dog"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "8af22028",
"en_raw": "is it really out there?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "bc1c3ed5",
"en_raw": "That story the other day"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "b4bda3af",
"en_raw": "I couldn't help worrying..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "b6465512",
"en_raw": "Attacking people because there's no food"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "6286e0bb",
"en_raw": "is that impossible?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "b7f26b20",
"en_raw": "I can't say for sure"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "064d035c",
"en_raw": "that there are none"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "c42ea50d",
"en_raw": "but apart from an escaped pet"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "4c365e51",
"en_raw": "the chance is low"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "a840125a",
"en_raw": "Distorted?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "f14cc0de",
"en_raw": "See, kitchen garbage"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "4466dc2a",
"en_raw": "around here, they put it"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "16117f6c",
"en_raw": "in boxes like this"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "89d2a0bc",
"en_raw": "So, first, there's no food"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "555ac9a6",
"en_raw": "so wouldn't it attack people"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "8f9389cc",
"en_raw": "or something...?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "0ad18c8b",
"en_raw": "No, an escaped dog"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "9f116848",
"en_raw": "doesn't have that kind of hunting ability"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "909e4dc6",
"en_raw": "On the other hand, it's not an environment"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "0678bdf7",
"en_raw": "a plain stray dog can survive in"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "692f9abc",
"en_raw": "So a dog roaming town"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "f5ce7afc",
"en_raw": "attacking people"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "ffcf704f",
"en_raw": "is basically impossible"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "27ee26a8",
"en_raw": "I see"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "71455146",
"en_raw": "Well, it never hurts"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "05cc2d7e",
"en_raw": "to be careful"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "0c1b810d",
"en_raw": "A stray dog's fate"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "c8b32e28",
"en_raw": "is crueler than you'd imagine"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "d4c75596",
"en_raw": "Anyway, you kids, just in case"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "c14ae3b1",
"en_raw": "be careful and head home early"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "9a11a4c0",
"en_raw": "Still not found?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "4d95441c",
"en_raw": "Ah, but the reports keep coming"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "e632b8f1",
"en_raw": "so we have no choice but to act"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "4bb6ec72",
"en_raw": "It's probably fine"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "3f987252",
"en_raw": "but you be careful too"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "0e87675e",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "ba172c81",
"en_raw": "We're going home too"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "46fe8487",
"en_raw": "Right, that's best"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "b433da56",
"en_raw": "Well, be careful"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "5aa0f5f1",
"en_raw": "Well, thank you very much"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "4bb6ec72",
"en_raw": "It's probably fine"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "3f987252",
"en_raw": "but you be careful too"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "31f99ae7",
"en_raw": "Looks like just a trash can..."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "6ae6cb3b",
"en_raw": "As you can see, nobody's here..."
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "753176f6",
"en_raw": "Could it be the black dog...?"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "f0fb6608",
"en_raw": "This is bad, Nao!"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "1dbc4287",
"en_raw": "Let's bring Melos after all"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "80480ea4",
"en_raw": "(I've got a bad feeling about this)"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "6472b7c5",
"en_raw": "(Maybe it'd be"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "dff60b76",
"en_raw": "better with Melos...)"
}
]
